  "description": "晴れた日の山道で、3人の高校生がハイキングを楽しんでいる。中央では男子生徒が分かれ道にある案内板を指さしながら紙の地図を確認している。隣の女子生徒は遠くに見える滝と山の景色をスマートフォンで撮影している。少し後ろでは別の女子生徒がベンチのそばで水筒に水を補給しながらバックパックを整えている。周囲には木々、野生の花、小川、木製の橋、登山道の標識があり、3人が景色を楽しみながら次の目的地へ向かう準備をしている。",
  "category": "action",
  "timeLimit": 45,
  "imagePrompt": "A high-quality, detailed illustration designed for an IELTS or Eiken English speaking picture-description test. Show exactly three teenage hikers on a beautiful mountain trail in Japan on a clear sunny day. Do not include any other people. The atmosphere should be adventurous, peaceful, positive, and visually rich. In the main foreground scene, a teenage boy wearing hiking clothes and a backpack is standing at a fork in the trail. He is holding an unfolded paper hiking map in one hand and pointing toward a wooden trail sign with the other hand, apparently deciding which route the group should take. Beside him, a teenage girl with a small backpack is holding a smartphone horizontally and taking a photograph of a scenic waterfall and distant mountains. She looks impressed and excited by the view. In the middle background, a second teenage girl is standing beside a simple wooden bench and adjusting her backpack while refilling a reusable water bottle from a safe public mountain water fountain. Around the three hikers, show a clear mountain environment with tall green trees, wildflowers, rocks, a shallow stream, a small wooden footbridge, distant mountains, a visible waterfall, hiking trail markers, a wooden direction sign, the bench, backpacks, trekking shoes, a paper map, smartphone, and reusable water bottle. The three people's activities must be clearly different and easy to describe: one checking the route, one photographing the scenery, and one preparing her equipment and water. Create clear foreground, middle ground, and background despite having only three people. No additional people, no crowds, no animals, no speech bubbles, no captions, no brand logos, no copyrighted characters. Landscape 16:9 composition, clean colorful educational illustration style, highly detailed but uncluttered, expressive natural body language, suitable for an English speaking assessment.",
